{"video_id":"WHIc6MMeMEU","title":"USENIX Security '26 - CompLeak: Deep Learning Model Compression Exacerbates Privacy Leakage","conference":"usenix-security","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1372,"segments":[{"start":22.6,"duration":4.56,"text":"I'm Nanli from Nanjing University of"},{"start":25.12,"duration":3.6,"text":"Science and Technology. I'm going to"},{"start":27.16,"duration":3.56,"text":"present our work"},{"start":28.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"complete deep learning model compression"},{"start":30.72,"duration":4.44,"text":"exists ways privacy leakage. This is a"},{"start":33.36,"duration":4.56,"text":"joint work with Yindong Gao from"},{"start":35.16,"duration":5.28,"text":"Southeast University, Hongshuo Wu from"},{"start":37.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"Shanghai Jiao Tong University, Boyu Quan"},{"start":40.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"and Aimin Fu from Nanjing University of"},{"start":42.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"Science and Technology."},{"start":44.72,"duration":3.88,"text":"In this work, we investigate an"},{"start":46.96,"duration":3.92,"text":"important but largely overlooked"},{"start":48.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"question, whether model compression can"},{"start":50.88,"duration":4.6,"text":"introduce additional privacy leakage."},{"start":53.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"Let me first briefly introduce model"},{"start":55.48,"duration":2.76,"text":"compression."},{"start":58.3,"duration":2.31,"text":">> [snorts]"},{"start":58.72,"duration":4.48,"text":">> Deep learning models have become larger"},{"start":60.6,"duration":4.48,"text":"and larger, which makes deployment on"},{"start":63.2,"duration":3.16,"text":"resource-constrained devices more"},{"start":65.08,"duration":3.36,"text":"difficult."},{"start":66.36,"duration":3.64,"text":"Model compression is a common solution"},{"start":68.44,"duration":3.64,"text":"to this problem."},{"start":70.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"It reduces the number of parameters,"},{"start":72.08,"duration":4.96,"text":"computation, and memory usage."},{"start":74.64,"duration":4.04,"text":"In this work, we consider three common"},{"start":77.04,"duration":3.88,"text":"compression methods."},{"start":78.68,"duration":4.72,"text":"The first is pruning, which removes"},{"start":80.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"weights with small magnitudes."},{"start":83.4,"duration":4.88,"text":"The second is quantization, which"},{"start":85.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"converts 32-bit floating-point weights"},{"start":88.28,"duration":5.4,"text":"into compact lower bit integers. The"},{"start":91.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"third is weight clustering,"},{"start":93.68,"duration":5.24,"text":"which groups similar weights together"},{"start":95.72,"duration":5.64,"text":"and replaces them with shared values."},{"start":98.92,"duration":6.92,"text":"These methods can significantly reduce"},{"start":101.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"the cost of model deployment."},{"start":106.72,"duration":5.92,"text":"To elevate privacy leakage, we use"},{"start":109.12,"duration":5.12,"text":"membership inference attacks, MIAs. The"},{"start":112.64,"duration":4.04,"text":"idea is simple."},{"start":114.24,"duration":3.92,"text":"Suppose a model is trained on private"},{"start":116.68,"duration":3.48,"text":"data set."},{"start":118.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"Given an attacked sample,"},{"start":120.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"the attack was to determine whether the"},{"start":122.44,"duration":3.76,"text":"sample was part of the model's training"},{"start":124.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"set."},{"start":126.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"If it was used for training, we call it"},{"start":128.64,"duration":3.64,"text":"a member. Otherwise, we call it a"},{"start":130.76,"duration":4.12,"text":"non-member."},{"start":132.28,"duration":5.16,"text":"In our setting, the attacker has black"},{"start":134.88,"duration":5.08,"text":"box access to the target model and can"},{"start":137.44,"duration":4.88,"text":"observe its output."},{"start":139.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"For [snorts] example, in this figure,"},{"start":142.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"the model predicts dog with 95%"},{"start":145.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"confidence."},{"start":146.96,"duration":5.08,"text":"Membership inference attack use this"},{"start":149.36,"duration":6.28,"text":"output information to distinguish"},{"start":152.04,"duration":3.6,"text":"members from non-members."},{"start":155.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"However, the privacy risk of model"},{"start":157.92,"duration":5.68,"text":"compression has been largely overlooked."},{"start":160.52,"duration":5.44,"text":"We identify two important issues."},{"start":163.6,"duration":4.16,"text":"First, many compression methods require"},{"start":165.96,"duration":3.04,"text":"fine-tuning on the original training"},{"start":167.76,"duration":3.68,"text":"data."},{"start":169.0,"duration":4.68,"text":"This means that compression does not"},{"start":171.44,"duration":4.64,"text":"simply make the model smaller. The"},{"start":173.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"fine-tuning process may also change how"},{"start":176.08,"duration":3.32,"text":"the model memorizes its training"},{"start":178.2,"duration":3.32,"text":"samples,"},{"start":179.4,"duration":5.8,"text":"potentially introducing additional"},{"start":181.52,"duration":3.68,"text":"privacy risk leakage."},{"start":185.4,"duration":5.88,"text":"Secondly, in practice, model providers"},{"start":188.24,"duration":4.84,"text":"may release multiple compressed versions"},{"start":191.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"of the same model."},{"start":193.08,"duration":5.08,"text":"For example, they may release models"},{"start":195.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"with different pruning rates."},{"start":198.16,"duration":4.2,"text":"An attacker may be able to query all"},{"start":200.2,"duration":4.08,"text":"these models and then combine the"},{"start":202.36,"duration":4.84,"text":"information from them."},{"start":204.28,"duration":6.04,"text":"However, the combined the privacy impact"},{"start":207.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"of multiple compressed models remain"},{"start":210.32,"duration":5.16,"text":"largely unexplored."},{"start":213.0,"duration":3.68,"text":"This leads to our main research"},{"start":215.48,"duration":3.12,"text":"question."},{"start":216.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"Does compression exist with privacy"},{"start":218.6,"duration":8.48,"text":"leakage as access to multiple compressed"},{"start":222.28,"duration":4.8,"text":"models grows, and if so, by how much?"},{"start":227.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"Now, let me introduce our threat model."},{"start":229.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"As shown on the left, a model provider"},{"start":232.04,"duration":4.88,"text":"releases our original model together"},{"start":234.24,"duration":6.12,"text":"with several compressed versions."},{"start":236.92,"duration":4.96,"text":"Such as models with 16, 17, and 18% of"},{"start":240.36,"duration":3.68,"text":"pruning."},{"start":241.88,"duration":5.48,"text":"The attacker can query every released"},{"start":244.04,"duration":6.84,"text":"version. We consider a black box setting"},{"start":247.36,"duration":6.12,"text":"where the attacker only observes"},{"start":250.88,"duration":4.68,"text":"outputs from the original model and its"},{"start":253.48,"duration":3.84,"text":"compressed versions."},{"start":255.56,"duration":3.52,"text":"The attacker also knows the model"},{"start":257.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"architecture and the compression"},{"start":259.08,"duration":6.36,"text":"configuration. Since this information is"},{"start":262.2,"duration":5.56,"text":"usually published by the model provider."},{"start":265.44,"duration":4.88,"text":"In addition, the attacker has a shadow"},{"start":267.76,"duration":6.32,"text":"dataset from the same distribution as"},{"start":270.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"the victim's training data, but with"},{"start":274.08,"duration":3.92,"text":"no overlap."},{"start":276.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"The attacker uses this side to train"},{"start":278.0,"duration":4.84,"text":"shadow models that mimic the behavior of"},{"start":280.68,"duration":5.52,"text":"the victim models."},{"start":282.84,"duration":5.72,"text":"Finally, given a tagged sample, the"},{"start":286.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"attacker's goal is to determine whether"},{"start":288.56,"duration":4.52,"text":"it was part of the victim model's"},{"start":290.56,"duration":5.08,"text":"training set."},{"start":293.08,"duration":4.96,"text":"Based on this shadow model, we propose"},{"start":295.64,"duration":4.76,"text":"our framework complete, which has three"},{"start":298.04,"duration":5.28,"text":"variants according to how many models"},{"start":300.4,"duration":5.8,"text":"the attacker can access. The first is"},{"start":303.32,"duration":4.16,"text":"complete NR, where NR stands for no"},{"start":306.2,"duration":4.76,"text":"reference."},{"start":307.48,"duration":7.2,"text":"Here, we applies existing MI's to one"},{"start":310.96,"duration":5.48,"text":"model in isolation. This serves as our"},{"start":314.68,"duration":4.72,"text":"baseline."},{"start":316.44,"duration":6.04,"text":"The second is complete SR, where SR"},{"start":319.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"stands for single reference. Here, we"},{"start":322.48,"duration":4.2,"text":"compare the original model with one"},{"start":324.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"compressed model."},{"start":326.68,"duration":8.28,"text":"By comparing their outputs, we capture"},{"start":330.16,"duration":7.92,"text":"the changes introduced by compression."},{"start":334.96,"duration":6.32,"text":"Finally, we have complete MR, where MR"},{"start":338.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"stands for multi-reference."},{"start":341.28,"duration":5.28,"text":"Here, we combine information from the"},{"start":343.76,"duration":3.92,"text":"original model and multiple compressed"},{"start":346.56,"duration":3.76,"text":"models"},{"start":347.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"to investigate why the multiple released"},{"start":350.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"versions can further"},{"start":352.28,"duration":5.2,"text":"amplify privacy leakage."},{"start":355.4,"duration":4.52,"text":"They are supposed to look at a complete"},{"start":357.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"analog. Complete analog is not a new"},{"start":359.92,"duration":4.84,"text":"technique. Instead, [snorts]"},{"start":361.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"we use six existing MI's to audit the"},{"start":364.76,"duration":4.44,"text":"original model and every compressed"},{"start":366.92,"duration":4.2,"text":"version independently."},{"start":369.2,"duration":3.8,"text":"These messages include tree-based"},{"start":371.12,"duration":4.88,"text":"attacks magic"},{"start":373.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"based attacks, and the Sota MI."},{"start":376.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"The purpose here is to establish a"},{"start":378.28,"duration":7.44,"text":"baseline and measure how much each"},{"start":380.6,"duration":5.12,"text":"compressed model leaks on its own."},{"start":388.32,"duration":3.64,"text":"Now, let us look at the experimental"},{"start":390.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"results."},{"start":391.96,"duration":4.4,"text":"We evaluate four datasets with four"},{"start":394.12,"duration":6.52,"text":"different model architectures."},{"start":396.36,"duration":8.12,"text":"Cifar with ResNet 18, Cifar 100 with"},{"start":400.64,"duration":7.64,"text":"ResNet 15, mini ImageNet with VGG 16,"},{"start":404.48,"duration":7.04,"text":"and tiny ImageNet with MobileNet V2."},{"start":408.28,"duration":6.52,"text":"For compression, we consider pruning"},{"start":411.52,"duration":5.48,"text":"from 16% to 19% sparsity,"},{"start":414.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"8-bit quantization, and the weight"},{"start":417.0,"duration":5.24,"text":"clustering with"},{"start":418.8,"duration":7.36,"text":"four weights and 16 clusters."},{"start":422.24,"duration":6.28,"text":"We report balanced accuracy, AUC, and"},{"start":426.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"TPR at 0.1%"},{"start":428.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"FPR."},{"start":430.16,"duration":4.92,"text":"Interestingly, we observe that"},{"start":433.12,"duration":4.6,"text":"highly compressed models are harder to"},{"start":435.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"attack indirectly."},{"start":437.72,"duration":5.36,"text":"For example, as the pruning rate"},{"start":440.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"increase, attack performance generally"},{"start":443.08,"duration":3.64,"text":"decrease."},{"start":444.6,"duration":5.84,"text":"The reason is that highly compressed"},{"start":446.72,"duration":7.72,"text":"reduce model overfitting, making members"},{"start":450.44,"duration":6.6,"text":"more similar similar to non-members."},{"start":454.44,"duration":4.92,"text":"However, this is all what we observe"},{"start":457.04,"duration":3.88,"text":"when each model is considered in"},{"start":459.36,"duration":4.68,"text":"isolation."},{"start":460.92,"duration":6.12,"text":"And this motivates our next method,"},{"start":464.04,"duration":3.0,"text":"complete ISR."},{"start":467.6,"duration":3.48,"text":"This brings us to the key insight of our"},{"start":470.04,"duration":2.92,"text":"work."},{"start":471.08,"duration":4.4,"text":"Although a highly compressed model may"},{"start":472.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"be harder to attack by itself,"},{"start":475.48,"duration":4.48,"text":"compression changes the posterior"},{"start":477.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"distributions of members and non-members"},{"start":479.96,"duration":3.36,"text":"differently."},{"start":481.52,"duration":5.36,"text":"Look at the figure."},{"start":483.32,"duration":7.6,"text":"Here, we compare the posterior outputs"},{"start":486.88,"duration":6.88,"text":"of the original MobileNetV2 and the uh"},{"start":490.92,"duration":5.28,"text":"pruned version on the same samples"},{"start":493.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"using KL divergence."},{"start":496.2,"duration":4.16,"text":"As we can see, members shift much more"},{"start":498.48,"duration":3.88,"text":"than non-members."},{"start":500.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"This difference provides a strong"},{"start":502.36,"duration":5.28,"text":"membership signal."},{"start":504.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"Therefore, in complete ISR, we use the"},{"start":507.64,"duration":5.32,"text":"original model as a reference and then"},{"start":509.84,"duration":6.72,"text":"compare it with one compressed model."},{"start":512.96,"duration":6.4,"text":"The attack contains five main steps."},{"start":516.56,"duration":5.64,"text":"First, we train the shadow models."},{"start":519.36,"duration":5.12,"text":"Second, we generate posterior outputs"},{"start":522.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"from both shadow, original, and the"},{"start":524.48,"duration":4.88,"text":"compressed models."},{"start":526.56,"duration":6.52,"text":"Third, we combine these posterior"},{"start":529.36,"duration":6.16,"text":"outputs to construct metadata."},{"start":533.08,"duration":5.56,"text":"Also, we use the metadata to train a"},{"start":535.52,"duration":5.56,"text":"binary attack membership classifier."},{"start":538.64,"duration":7.04,"text":"Finally, we apply the attack to the"},{"start":541.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"victim models and then infer membership."},{"start":546.44,"duration":5.08,"text":"Now, let us look at the results."},{"start":549.68,"duration":4.88,"text":"Regardless of the compression type and"},{"start":551.52,"duration":5.6,"text":"level, complete ISR consistently"},{"start":554.56,"duration":4.96,"text":"outperforms complete LLR."},{"start":557.12,"duration":5.68,"text":"Let me highlight one example."},{"start":559.52,"duration":7.08,"text":"For the 19% pruned VGG16,"},{"start":562.8,"duration":6.44,"text":"TPR at 0.1% FPR"},{"start":566.6,"duration":5.84,"text":"increases from 2.3%"},{"start":569.24,"duration":3.2,"text":"to 25.5%"},{"start":574.0,"duration":3.68,"text":"These results show that compression"},{"start":576.56,"duration":4.88,"text":"introduces"},{"start":577.68,"duration":8.88,"text":"privacy leakage and that can be observed"},{"start":581.44,"duration":5.12,"text":"by attacking either model independently."},{"start":587.32,"duration":5.6,"text":"Next we consider what happens when the"},{"start":589.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"attacker can access multiple compressed"},{"start":592.92,"duration":4.2,"text":"versions."},{"start":594.16,"duration":5.8,"text":"This motivates complete MR. Our key"},{"start":597.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"observation is that different compressed"},{"start":599.96,"duration":3.64,"text":"versions leak membership information"},{"start":601.96,"duration":4.84,"text":"differently."},{"start":603.6,"duration":5.6,"text":"We identify two useful signals."},{"start":606.8,"duration":4.84,"text":"The first signal comes from the complete"},{"start":609.2,"duration":4.76,"text":"isometric classifiers."},{"start":611.64,"duration":5.72,"text":"Different compression levels produce"},{"start":613.96,"duration":5.52,"text":"different isometric classifiers."},{"start":617.36,"duration":4.68,"text":"And these classifiers make different"},{"start":619.48,"duration":4.4,"text":"membership predictions for the same"},{"start":622.04,"duration":4.96,"text":"sample."},{"start":623.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"This disagreement itself provides useful"},{"start":627.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"membership information."},{"start":629.72,"duration":3.72,"text":"The second signal comes from the loss."},{"start":632.4,"duration":3.44,"text":"As the"},{"start":633.44,"duration":4.96,"text":"pruning rate increase, the loss of"},{"start":635.84,"duration":5.08,"text":"member samples shows a clear"},{"start":638.4,"duration":6.0,"text":"increasing trend where the loss of"},{"start":640.92,"duration":5.84,"text":"non-member samples mainly fluctuates."},{"start":644.4,"duration":5.72,"text":"Complete MR combines these signals"},{"start":646.76,"duration":5.08,"text":"across multiple compressed models."},{"start":650.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"The pipeline includes shadow model"},{"start":651.84,"duration":6.28,"text":"training, post posterior connection,"},{"start":655.28,"duration":4.72,"text":"loss connection, attack method"},{"start":658.12,"duration":4.92,"text":"classifier training, and finally"},{"start":660.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"membership inference."},{"start":663.04,"duration":5.68,"text":"Now, let us look at the complete MR"},{"start":665.72,"duration":5.92,"text":"results. For pruning, we combine four"},{"start":668.72,"duration":6.08,"text":"compressed models with sparsity levels"},{"start":671.64,"duration":3.92,"text":"from 0.6 to 0.9."},{"start":674.8,"duration":2.96,"text":"For"},{"start":675.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"weak clustering, we combine three"},{"start":677.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"compressed models with four, eight, and"},{"start":680.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"16 clusters."},{"start":682.36,"duration":5.8,"text":"The results clearly shows that multiple"},{"start":685.68,"duration":4.68,"text":"compressed models can further amplify"},{"start":688.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"privacy leakage."},{"start":690.36,"duration":6.6,"text":"For all three compression operations are"},{"start":693.2,"duration":8.16,"text":"combined with any model seen today."},{"start":696.96,"duration":5.88,"text":"ComLeak MI replaces 95.7%"},{"start":701.36,"duration":4.08,"text":"TPR at"},{"start":702.84,"duration":6.92,"text":"0.1% FPR."},{"start":705.44,"duration":7.08,"text":"With AUC close to 100%."},{"start":709.76,"duration":7.04,"text":"Therefore, multiple compressed models"},{"start":712.52,"duration":6.64,"text":"further amplify privacy leakage."},{"start":716.8,"duration":4.84,"text":"To summarize, we propose ComLeak, a"},{"start":719.16,"duration":4.76,"text":"framework for evaluating the privacy"},{"start":721.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"risk of model compression through"},{"start":723.92,"duration":6.64,"text":"membership inference."},{"start":725.8,"duration":6.88,"text":"First, ComLeak MI implies existing MIs."},{"start":730.56,"duration":3.76,"text":"Relying solely on information from the"},{"start":732.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"underlying model."},{"start":734.32,"duration":4.0,"text":"ComSize privacy leakage per compressed"},{"start":736.84,"duration":4.4,"text":"model."},{"start":738.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"Second, ComLeak IS also side."},{"start":741.24,"duration":3.8,"text":"Compression affects members and"},{"start":743.2,"duration":3.8,"text":"non-members equally."},{"start":745.04,"duration":4.84,"text":"Combining a compressed model with the"},{"start":747.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"original model reveals"},{"start":749.88,"duration":5.44,"text":"additional privacy leakage. Third,"},{"start":752.72,"duration":5.28,"text":"ComLeak MI is also side. Combining"},{"start":755.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"information from multiple compressed"},{"start":758.0,"duration":4.16,"text":"models can further amplify this privacy"},{"start":760.44,"duration":5.56,"text":"leakage."},{"start":762.16,"duration":3.84,"text":"Thank you very much for your attention."}]}